{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30233","headline":"九日曲池游眺 · 薛逢","name":"九日曲池游眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"陌上秋风动酒旗，江头丝竹竞相追。\n正当海晏河清日，便是修文偃武时。\n绣毂尽爲行乐伴，艳歌皆属太平诗。\n微臣辛忝颁尧历，一望郊原惬所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30233.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30233","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}